        <presentation>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW30759063 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW30759063 BCX8"&gt;How has this course impacted your ability to independently learn new topics or develop new skills?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</mattext>
